# .bureau configuration examples

## Example office config (.bureau/config.yaml inside a project)
This file lives in each project's `.bureau/` directory. The global registry
(`~/.bureau/confix.yaml`) tracks all offices and which one is active.

```yaml
# /path/to/project/.bureau/config.yaml
id: my-project
name: "My Project"

# Where the actual project files live (can be outside the office)
worksite: /path/to/real/project

# Ticket/plantion directory layout relative to this file's location
layout:
  interviews_dir: .bureau/tickets
  plans_dir:    .bureau/plans
  executions_dir: .bureau/executions

# LLM provider overrides for specific modes.
# Starts as global (Decision Q22/A), planning per-office override (Q22/C).
providers:
  architect:
    name: "openai"
    model: "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022"
    base_url: "https://api.openai.com/v1"
    # api_key_source handled by environment
```

## Global config (`~/.bureau/config.yaml`)
This tracks all known offices for the sidebar + command palette to render.

```yaml
offices:
  - id: my-project
    name: "My Project"
    worksite: /path/to/real/project
    status: active

default_provider:
  name: "openai"
  base_url: "https://api.openai.com/v1"
  model: "gpt-4o"
  api_key_source:
    type: env
    variable: "OPENAI_API_KEY"

tui_layout: sidebar   # or "tab" — user preference

## Skills loading order (D18)
# Global skills are loaded first, then office-specific skills.
# Multiple SKILL.md files in the same directory are loaded alphabetically.
skills:
  global_paths:
    - ~/.bureau/skills/bureaucrat/SKILL.md
    - ~/.bureau/skills/worker/SKILL.md
  office_paths:
    - .bureau/skills/

## Run configuration defaults (D20)
defaults:
  mode: execution          # default mode when entering office dashboard
  provider: openai-gpt4   # preferred LLM provider

## Inspector permissions config (D21)
inspector_scope:
  auto_grant_to_user: true   # inspector scope expansion bypasses architect gatekeeper
  audit_log_path: office/permissions.log

## Dashboard preferences (D22)
tui_dashboard:
  show_archived_tickets: false   # default state of archive filter toggle
  worker_progress_format: "progressbar"  # or "simple"
  dependency_render_style: "unicode"  # or "ascii", or "none"

## Secret unlock settings (D16)
secret_unlock:
  require_permit_scope: true     # only allow unlocks within permit's scope
  audit_on_request: true         # log each secret request to permissions.log
```

